<title>USA: Mercer County, N.J., solid waste bonds repriced.</title>
<headline>Mercer County, N.J., solid waste bonds repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Friday it repriced and restructured Mercer County Improvement Authority, N.J.'s $44.6 million solid waste bond issue. The top yield at the repricing was approximately 5.793 percent.</p>
<p>THE MERCER COUNTY IMPROVEMENT AUTHORITY</p>
<p>MERCER COUNTY, NEW JERSEY</p>
<p>RE: $44,630,000*</p>
<p>COUNTY GUARANTEED SOLID WASTE BONDS, SERIES 1997</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES OF DTC</p>
<p>NOTE REPRICING AND RESTRUCTURING.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aa2		 S&amp;P: AA-</p>
<p>		 (CONFIRMED)	    (CONFIRMED)</p>
<p>    DATED: 03/15/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 03/15/1998</p>
